{
    "title": "MANGA Plus by SHUEISHA",
    "description": "MANGA Plus by SHUEISHA, is the official manga reading service from Shueisha, that provides you with the latest chapters for free at the same time as in Japan. Immerse yourself in binge-worthy and anime-adapted comics like; One Piece, Chainsaw Man, Boruto: Two Blue Vortex, Jujutsu Kaisen, My Hero Academia, \u3010OSHI NO KO\u3011, Dandadan and Red Cat Ramen.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the first three and newest three chapters for FREE. Want to catch up on SPY x FAMILY, Kaiju No.8 (Monster #8), and Kagurabachi? You can read all chapters of currently ongoing manga in English once for free! Some titles are also available in other languages, including Spanish, Thai, Portuguese, Indonesian, Russian, French, German, and Vietnamese*. Available titles may vary by language and region.\r\n\r\nWant unlimited reading with no ads? MANGA Plus MAX is just for you! Access over 17,000 chapters in English from anywhere in the world*. Standard Plan will keep you up to date with current ongoing comics. Upgrade to the Deluxe Plan to dive into current comics as well as completed classics like Dragon Ball, NARUTO, BLEACH, Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba, Death Note, Tokyo Ghoul, Haikyuu! and Bakuman.! *Unavailable in Japan, China, and Korea. Prices and available titles vary by country/region. Only English titles are available in the subscription plan.\r\n\r\nUsing this official service means that your support goes directly to the creators who work tirelessly to bring you new stories.\r\n\r\nDownload now and embark on a journey through captivating narratives, with fresh chapters waiting for you every day!\r\n\r\nFollow us on our social media accounts for news and information\r\nX: https://twitter.com/mangaplus_o\r\nDiscord: https://discord.com/invite/qAkpHxH\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/mangaplus.en/",
    "descriptionHTML": "MANGA Plus by SHUEISHA, is the official manga reading service from Shueisha, that provides you with the latest chapters for free at the same time as in Japan. Immerse yourself in binge-worthy and anime-adapted comics like; One Piece, Chainsaw Man, Boruto: Two Blue Vortex, Jujutsu Kaisen, My Hero Academia, \u3010OSHI NO KO\u3011, Dandadan and Red Cat Ramen.<br><br>Enjoy the first three and newest three chapters for FREE. Want to catch up on SPY x FAMILY, Kaiju No.8 (Monster #8), and Kagurabachi? You can read all chapters of currently ongoing manga in English once for free! Some titles are also available in other languages, including Spanish, Thai, Portuguese, Indonesian, Russian, French, German, and Vietnamese*. Available titles may vary by language and region.<br><br>Want unlimited reading with no ads? MANGA Plus MAX is just for you! Access over 17,000 chapters in English from anywhere in the world*. Standard Plan will keep you up to date with current ongoing comics. Upgrade to the Deluxe Plan to dive into current comics as well as completed classics like Dragon Ball, NARUTO, BLEACH, Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba, Death Note, Tokyo Ghoul, Haikyuu! and Bakuman.! *Unavailable in Japan, China, and Korea. Prices and available titles vary by country/region. Only English titles are available in the subscription plan.<br><br>Using this official service means that your support goes directly to the creators who work tirelessly to bring you new stories.<br><br>Download now and embark on a journey through captivating narratives, with fresh chapters waiting for you every day!<br><br>Follow us on our social media accounts for news and information<br>X: https://twitter.com/mangaplus_o<br>Discord: https://discord.com/invite/qAkpHxH<br>Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/mangaplus.en/",
